{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "39fe05bb19d5634a796018dc0eee6559dbdd3aca434477497870b5c0f67721dc", "ja": "可憐とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与可怜一起外出时的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "184c6e28688c34cfc24f7c8e26f1a38286e3cb74a60bdc0eb48c533a1b2fb7c1", "ja": "（可憐と一緒に、秋芳洞にやってきた。東洋一の\n鍾乳洞と呼ばれるだけあって、すごかったな！）", "zh": "（和可怜一起来到了秋芳洞。不愧被称为东方第一钟乳洞，真是壮观啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "b577f053a27fe0a7a4155a0feb83105fa8485985b439cfc8bc9261098071bbe0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、つれてきてくれて\nありがとうございます。と、とっても楽しかった……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您带我过来。\n非、非常开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c768e4249915521b3786170866b42801d802f24f3576539f84083c98a55e06e1", "ja": "ああ、楽しかったな。ひんやりしていて、\n気持ちもよかったし。", "zh": "啊，玩得很开心啊。凉飕飕的，感觉也很舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "e54700ad68d83f51dd439d3a9abcb0c15f1153a14b840c366c0b6baeef29f251", "ja": "はい。\nそ、それに……自然の神秘を、感じました。", "zh": "是的。\n还、还有……我感受到了大自然的神秘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f6bdec8edcb8d18ff204e3e5faba1dc49b0e83b2e1e90cfaa2f895f5a7dfc4ad", "ja": "そうだな。膨大な年月をかけて、\nあの光景が作られたんだな……。", "zh": "是啊。历经漫长岁月，才形成了那样的景象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "29d3caf80b30d2a461a4989e799f3893f55ae5a5278f52b75ab5a3c9d21b5f99", "ja": "……。\n{$P$}さん……わ、私……。", "zh": "……。\n{$P$}先生……我、我也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "64808749bbf75d9684dff401c6f3cb6c573a502e63671ae416b49e08d355f6b3", "ja": "わ、私も、秋芳洞みたいになりたいです……っ！", "zh": "我、我也想像秋芳洞那样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "01ad9d1eef9582108b29b8f00e924dd8bb8a0e261572edc7a31a7d5d1cf7d0f9", "ja": "あ、変なこと言ってすみません！　その、な、長く\n活動すればするほど、磨かれるようなアイドルに……。", "zh": "啊，说了奇怪的话真是对不起！那个，越、越是长期活动，就越能不断磨砺自己，成为这样的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6614fe879b90317cc9f0128352d2eaf56d1e79965f108cee64d5c335a8dc8dc6", "ja": "ああ、そういう意味だったのか。\nなるほど、面白い表現だ。可憐はセンスがあるな。", "zh": "啊，原来你是这个意思。\n这样啊，真是个有趣的说法。可怜很有品味嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "aadc3c9cae734e3e8cc8c38c33dd50a91548f35ab7c1d47bd1225859a4789334", "ja": "ううっ……し、真剣に言ったのに……。も、もう、\n{$P$}さんなんか、知りません……！", "zh": "呜呜……我、我很认真在说耶……真、真是的，\n我不理{$P$}先生了啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0f24a4509e050b95fed78101f15ca8f43b31f0c28eebf9c88f67e65385fdeac1", "ja": "（可憐が拗ねた表情をするのは珍しいけど……\nでも、どんな可憐もやっぱり可愛いな！）", "zh": "（可怜露出闹别扭的表情还真少见……不过，不管是什么样的可怜，果然都很可爱啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
